<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2873] Add documentation on Zeppelin Shiro&apos;s abliity to configure secure cookie</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2873</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;As per &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AMBARI-21675&quot; title=&quot;Add Secure Flag to Cookie / JSESSIONID in Zeppelin&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;AMBARI-21675&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;AMBARI-21675&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, secure flag attribute must be set on session cookies containing session tokens for Zeppelin Application. Our doc page on Shiro Authentication (&lt;a href=&quot;http://zeppelin.apache.org/docs/0.8.0-SNAPSHOT/setup/security/shiro_authentication.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://zeppelin.apache.org/docs/0.8.0-SNAPSHOT/setup/security/shiro_authentication.html&lt;/a&gt;) should talk about this as well.&lt;br/&gt;
This bug is to track the doc changes required.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
